 new named Program Advances (31 -> 49), each usable by a Hoenn line; the PA
 Dex (FOLDER > PA DEX) with hints, a chip for each first find, milestones
 every 5 (folder +1 up to 43, programs, * chips) and a Busting point for a
 Program Advance used

